  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The finished Gu is sparkling and translucent, bent like a crescent, resembling a piece of water blue crystal. It looks like Moonlight Gu enlarged twofold.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After a failed fusion attempt, he succeeds. The finished Gu is sparkling and translucent, bent like a crescent, and looks like a water-blue crystal about twice the size of Moonlight Gu. It is the higher-ranking rank two Moonglow Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Once he has it, it can reside in his right palm and show moonlight there when activated. He can also withdraw it into the aperture so its aura does not leak.",
        "chapters": [
          119
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The attack is still a moonblade: an eerie blue crescent launched from the hand. Onlookers in the village recognize Fang Yuan’s blade as Moonglow rather than Moonlight after he fires a face-sized crescent that cuts a desk clean through.",
        "chapters": [
          108
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Gossip after that fight already treats the refinement as fact: rank two talk says he has wealth and has also refined Moonglow Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          109
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against the rank one form, Moonglow is a clear step up. One Little Light Gu raises moonblade power by 100%, and a second Little Light Gu does not stack that boost additively; the fused rank two Moonglow reaches three times Moonlight Gu’s attack power. Attack range stays ten meters.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the stone forest, one Moonglow moonblade can kill five or six jade eye stone monkeys where Moonlight Gu with Little Light Gu help used to kill one or two.",
        "chapters": [
          114
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Each moonblade costs about 10% of Fang Yuan’s light red rank two primeval essence. At rank two initial stage that means four moonblades from a full sea of that strength;",
        "chapters": [
          114
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "middle stage doubles the count to eight, and upper stage doubles again to sixteen.",
        "chapters": [
          122
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He refines it as his rank two attack Gu while pairing it with White Jade Gu for defense.",
        "chapters": [
          107
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_attack_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He first shows the moonblade in public when he wounds Gu Yue Man Shi in the wine tavern without warning, cutting a desk clean through, then threatens him until Man Shi flees.",
        "chapters": [
          108
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_man_shi"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "From then on it is his main long-range cut in the stone forest,",
        "chapters": [
          114
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "and against crippled wolf packs on Qing Mao Mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          122
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It eats moon orchid petals. During the wolf-tide period Fang Yuan hunts partly to gather merit points so he can exchange for those petals for this Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited chapter states a petal meal count or daily schedule for Moonglow Gu itself.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The stated recipe is Moonlight Gu plus two Little Light Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          98
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-recipe",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan fails once and loses one Little Light Gu; the surviving Moonlight Gu and Little Light Gu are injured and need recovery before another try. Days later the fusion succeeds.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-recipe",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "This path sits among several Moonlight advancements. Fang Yuan picks it to raise moonblade attack power to the limit on that line, while other routes produce Moon Scar Gu, Moonwhirl Gu, or Moon Raiment instead.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-recipe",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_moonscar_gu",
          "gu_moonwhirl_gu",
          "gu_moon_raiment"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
