  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan first names Moonglow Gu while planning rank two fusions after reaching rank two initial stage. He lists Moonlight Gu with two Little Light Gu as the mix that forms it, and treats that line as a surge in attack power beside White Jade Gu for defense.",
        "chapters": [
          98
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_moonlight_gu",
          "gu_little_light_gu",
          "gu_white_jade_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan browses clan rank three recipes, he notes that his own line began by fusing Moonlight Gu with Little Light Gu into Moonglow Gu, and that only a few further recipes on that base were worth using: Golden Moon, Frost Moon, and Illusory Moon Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "advancement-past-moonglow",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_frost_moon_gu",
          "gu_illusory_moon_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He instead chooses Blood Moon Gu, formed from rank two Moonglow Gu and Blood Essence Gu. That product keeps a face-sized moonblade, turns it blood red, adds a bleeding effect, and switches its food from moon orchid petals to fresh blood. He fails that refinement once and succeeds on the second attempt, combining the Moonglow Gu into the finished rank three Blood Moon Gu that then resides in his right palm.",
        "chapters": [
          157
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "advancement-past-moonglow",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_blood_moon_gu",
          "gu_blood_essence_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he reaches rank three, he rates Blood Moon Gu as far superior to Moonglow Gu in attack power.",
        "chapters": [
          162
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "advancement-past-moonglow",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
